  {
   "id": "skautfold-into-the-fray-107925@post-2019-05-15",
   "gameId": "skautfold-into-the-fray-107925",
   "displayName": "Moonless Knight first \"trailer\"",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2019-05-15T16:49:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Enjoy, and remember text sounds have their own volume slider and can be turned off entirely.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "JOIN OUR DISCORD",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As always, we strongly recommend that you join our Discord server if you want to be completely up-to-date, or just want to hang out. We are extremely active on there, posting updates and screenshots most days. And if you're worried about spoilers, we have dedicated rooms for those, so they're easy to avoid. It's also super convenient for us to receive bug reports since you can post images, but it's also a direct way to give us suggestions and other comments.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "OUR STEAM GROUP",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Alternatively, if you don't use Discord, please consider joining our developer page here on Steam to get the latest news and updates, discuss any Pugware game, or report issues:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Pugware Steam Group",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
