   "id": "skautfold-into-the-fray-107925@post-2019-04-19",
   "gameId": "skautfold-into-the-fray-107925",
   "displayName": "Have your name appear in Moonless Knight.",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2019-04-19T13:23:41.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Read the rules and comment your name HERE: https://steamcommunity.com/games/1029170/announcements/detail/1636405351612856552",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Any names posted here will be disregarded entirely.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As for news regarding development on the 4th game, things are not going too well. While I feel like it will be my most polished and possibly best game yet currently I am barely making anything off my games following the algorithm change on Steam a few months back. I am trying my absolute best to finish at least this 4th game but if that fails to turn a bare minimum I will have to cancel the series early and retire from making games.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "JOIN OUR DISCORD",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As always, we strongly recommend that you join our Discord server if you want to be completely up-to-date, or just want to hang out. We are extremely active on there, posting updates and screenshots most days. And if you're worried about spoilers, we have dedicated rooms for those, so they're easy to avoid. It's also super convenient for us to receive bug reports since you can post images, but it's also a direct way to give us suggestions and other comments.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "OUR STEAM GROUP",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Alternatively, if you don't use Discord, please consider joining our developer page here on Steam to get the latest news and updates, discuss any Pugware game, or report issues:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Pugware Steam Group",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "https://www.facebook.com/pugwaredev",
     "items": [
